damage (I mean, you're already using true magick to enhance piss, may as well go for the gold).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T09:07:53-08:00","id":1044012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Theodrim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1035738-mages-are-nothing-but-prey-to-other-supernaturals?p=1043982#post1043982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think it would actually be Life 3 (Better Body) to take a Mega-Piss. Since you'd either be magically increasing your bladder's capacity, overclocking your kidneys, or transmuting the water in your own body to pee. Either way you'd better have a few gallons of Gatorade handy, since that pee has to come from <i>somewhere</i> and something like that would have the propensity to turn Vulgar pretty quick.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> For pressure, I think Forces would work better. Or just default to Life 3 to strengthen the PC muscles (which from this point forward I will refer to as MagicKegels, or &quot;the Cytherea rote&quot;). The Prime would only come in, I think, if you were generating the piss <i>ex nihilo</i> or wanted your piss stream to do aggravated damage (I mean, you're already using true magick to